  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As of posting this, the only way for us to \"limit\" eye tracking is through cats-plugin. This works well enough for most humanoid avatars out there. This setup does not cater for non-humanoid heads with either mechanical or \"fluid\" like eye movement. A strength value or movement limitation should be added for more customization options so that we could have more control over the movement of the eyes.",
